{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every vertex B-connected to "},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" included, in vertex-index order: Gallo et"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"al.‘s B-Visit (halp’s "},{"code":"b_visit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). A hyperedge fires once every one of its sources has been"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reached, and then reaches all its targets. On a directed graph read as a hypergraph this is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reachability."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/graphprotocols\/directedhypergraph\/bconnectedvertices(from:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/bConnectedVertices(from:)"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bConnectedVertices","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"source","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa"},{"text":") -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"B-connection here is path-based, as B-Visit computes it: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"v"},{"text":" is B-connected to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"v"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"text":", or some hyperedge with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"v"},{"text":" among its targets is entered along a path","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"text":" (it has a source, and all its sources are B-connected). So ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a hyperedge with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no sources never fires"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": no path enters it, and B-Visit scans only the forward stars of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reached vertices. The recursive reading (“every source is B-connected”) would fire it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vacuously from any start; Gallo et al.’s visit and halp do not.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","name":"Precondition","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"text":" is a vertex.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Complexity","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(n + m + p): one counter per hyperedge and one queue; one hash.","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bConnectedVertices"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text"